### Configuración de Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ==========================================
### 1. MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN (AUTH)
### ==========================================

### Generar JWT con las credenciales del .env
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ==========================================
### 2. MÓDULO DE LIBROS (BOOKS)
### ==========================================

### Listar todos los libros con paginación y búsqueda (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search=Harry&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Obtener un libro por ID (GET /:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Crear un nuevo libro (POST /)
# Nota: Ajusta los IDs (authorId, genreId, sagaId, shelfId) según los que existan en tu BD.
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter y la Piedra Filosofal",
  "isbn": "9788498387070",
  "publicationYear": 1997,
  "pages": 254,
  "authorId": 3,
  "genreId": 1,
  "sagaId": 1,
  "shelfId": 1
}

###

### Actualizar un libro parcialmente (PUT /:id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pages": 260,
  "title": "Harry Potter y la Piedra Filosofal (Edición Ilustrada)"
}

###

### Eliminar un libro por ID (DELETE /:id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}